          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Dead_Golfer-On_Course-86.jpg",
            "heading": "Exclusive\nnew gear",
            "description": "Introducing our Limited Edition All Day Knit 3 and LUX Hybrid with Dead Golfer detailing and features. The LE capsule also includes new apparel and accessory launches,<b> but keep an eye out for an exclusive ONE of 100 drop coming mid-month (hint: not shoes & they'll be a hit #IYKYK). <\/b>",
